Metrology — in Short — Howarth and Redgrave (@met-short: 0, is #book, #part-of @met-sources) { r_348S70JD4Z4VX9S3KA08JXQ2MS
Preben Howarth and Fiona Redgrave. Metrology — in Short, third edition. EURAMET, July 2008. English. ISBN 978-87-988154-5-7.

[Official complete PDF](https://www.euramet.org/Media/docs/Publications/Metrology_in_short_3rd_ed.pdf).

Read the whole handbook for an initial map of scientific, industrial, and legal metrology, technical subject areas, and the institutions that keep measurements comparable. Then replace its historical unit definitions and institutional details with the current SI Brochure, practical realizations, and CIPM MRA sources linked here. The older handbook is a readable map, not the authority for the post-2019 SI.

Copyright EURAMET e.V. 2008; the booklet has its own translation and reproduction notices, including separate image credits. Authorized free reading is available; no open adaptation licence is inferred. Title, authors, edition, and notice checked in the publisher’s PDF on 28 October 2026. The fourth-edition project page alone does not establish that a completed new edition has been published.

